cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results or this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PMx Landscape"
abstract: >-
  How pharmacometric modelling is done and used in practice, and how this
  changes over time, measured from FDA reviews of new drugs, the published
  literature (PubMed and Europe PMC) and PAGE meeting abstracts. The first
  measure is the estimation software used. The corpus, the classifications
  and the tag database behind every number are included.
type: software
